{"transcript":"ˈtʃiːpæs","exists":true,"definitions":["A person who is excessively unwilling to spend money.","Something of very low quality or value."],"examples":["Don't be such a cheap-ass.","He bought a cheap-ass car.","That cheap-ass broke already."],"lemma":"cheap-ass","lemmaPos":"noun","synonyms":["tightwad","skinflint","miser","penny-pincher"],"number":"singular","pluralForm":"cheap-asses","source":"cheap-ass"}